---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import { onlineEnquiries } from '../data/contact';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Kaiyu Select" description="Privacy information for the Kaiyu Select website.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span>Website information</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell legal"><p>Last updated: 6 November 2026</p><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>This website does not currently collect information through a website database. If you contact Kaiyu Select by email, the information you provide will be used to understand and respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>Contact form</h2>{onlineEnquiries ? <><p>Online enquiries are sent to Kaiyu Select by Resend. Cloudflare Turnstile checks submissions for spam. Your name, email address and enquiry are used to respond; no enquiry database is maintained by this website.</p><p>Cloudflare processes technical information for security. A short-lived, salted identifier derived from your IP address is used to limit repeated requests and expires after ten minutes of inactivity. Email providers may retain messages under their own policies.</p><p>You can use your email app instead. <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy information</a> and <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy">Resend privacy information</a> describe their processing.</p></> : <p>The enquiry helper prepares a draft in your email app or copies the details to your clipboard. It does not send or save your message to a website backend. Your email provider's privacy terms may apply when you send an email.</p>}<h2>Website data</h2><p>Basic technical information may be processed by the website hosting provider to deliver and protect the website. No advertising trackers are intentionally included.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:contact@kaiyuselect.com.au">contact@kaiyuselect.com.au</a>.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
